{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000030376","bookName":"Me acosaron por vegetariana, pero soy vampira","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000030376/42000030376.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":335820,"followCount":14795,"introduction":"Soy la única vegetariana en una dinastía de vampiros. La mimada heredera multimillonaria que robó mi castillo creyó que eso me hacía débil. Destruyó mi jardín, blanqueó a mis murciélagos hasta matarlos, me puso un collar como a un perro y me ató a una cruz bajo el sol. Luego mi familia volvió. Sus cuatro hermanos supieron que su fortuna era de mi madre, que su \"princesa\" no era ni una Palacios, y que ella planeaba quemarnos vivos.","chapterCount":30,"labels":["Family Bonds","Hidden Identity"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Hidden Identity"],"typeTwoIds":[336],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":336,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Me-acosaron-por-vegetariana-pero-soy-vampira","bookNameLower":"me-acosaron-por-vegetariana-pero-soy-vampira","shelfTime":"2026-10-11 10:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-10-11 10:00:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701748123","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/32/6x7/67x3/673x0/67303000024/701748123_1/701748123.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=N8gqHgk--h0Ggoxh8IJtYQZEPzbZScKtmNjnndoYGTByt3gSnftbBlQZDZH9gwiR7Dch-crulgWxHxcxWdzP7atiarl2H24-9Vwl85FplVxftfd0uYBnmiIR8b8NfVoajXXUb2XPp1oSDSoBSyvV2ER0yu2eZkCof28fu4ZcWqEjagx8wkE9R5mlMQ-AoQyTYjUwuQRzcj8vUF9GT0Ek67QuRqhHtt0hl5Bvdvix2pBFvcRbpUD6WfGRbor4hmWMnSPkGxm1T6TzYe~MLZqDpjDnr2WXYs9trtbRd0dnZ5w0dQ5j0q5DY32LUkDwHIifyBWusT1PZJaWiON3Yz8i2w__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/32/6x7/67x3/673x0/67303000024/701748123_1/701748123.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":192585,"price":0},{"id":"701748124","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://h